<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Facture {{ invoice.invoiceNumber }} - Aiolia Event</title>
    {% include 'emails/_base_email_style.html.twig' %}
    <style>
        .invoice-info {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .invoice-info-item {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .invoice-info-item strong {
            display: block;
            color: #6C757D;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        .invoice-info-item span,
        .invoice-info-item div {
            color: #1F2D3D;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .invoice-info {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 12px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-card">
            <div class="email-header">
                <h1>Votre facture</h1>
                <p>Facture N° {{ invoice.invoiceNumber }}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="email-body">
                <div class="greeting">
                    <p>Bonjour {{ customer.prenom }},</p>
                    <p>Vous trouverez ci-joint votre facture pour l'achat de billet(s) d'événement.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="invoice-details">
                    <h2>Détails de la facture</h2>
                    <div class="invoice-info">
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Numéro de facture</strong>
                            {{ invoice.invoiceNumber }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Date d'émission</strong>
                            {{ invoice.issuedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Type</strong>
                            Facture de billet
                        </div>
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Statut</strong>
                            {% if invoice.status == 'paid' %}
                                <span style="color: #27AE60; font-weight: 600;">Payée</span>
                            {% elseif invoice.status == 'issued' %}
                                <span style="color: #F39C12; font-weight: 600;">Émise</span>
                            {% else %}
                                <span style="color: #3498DB; font-weight: 600;">{{ invoice.status }}</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="invoice-amounts">
                        <div class="amount-row">
                            <span class="amount-label">Sous-total HT:</span>
                            <span class="amount-value">{{ invoice.subtotalAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="amount-row">
                            <span class="amount-label">TVA (20%):</span>
                            <span class="amount-value">{{ invoice.taxAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="amount-row total">
                            <span class="amount-label">Total TTC:</span>
                            <span class="amount-value total">{{ invoice.totalAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #495057; margin: 24px 0;">
                    Vous pouvez télécharger votre facture au format PDF depuis votre espace client.
                </p>

                <div class="cta">
                    <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_profile_index')) }}" style="background: #3498DB; color: #ffffff;">Accéder à mon espace</a>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6C757D; margin-top: 24px;">
                    Besoin d'aide ? Contactez notre support à <a href="mailto:support@aiolia-event.com" style="color: #3498DB;">support@aiolia-event.com</a>.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>Cet e-mail a été envoyé automatiquement. Merci de ne pas répondre directement.</p>
                <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Aiolia Event – Tous droits réservés.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

